        <activityName xml:lang="en">Roof tile, market mix, at regional storage</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Roof tile, market mix, at regional storage
pipeline transport is modelled as freight train transport.;
UUID: 9a24b457-efb1-3190-b9de-7b7d6b6f59f1
This data set accounts for 1 kg of roof tiles at the regional storage. 9% are from import, 91% are produced in Switzerland. The imported share is weighted with a factor of 1.1. The imported goods are delievered to Switzerland to 70% from Germany, 16% from Italy 8% from Austria, 2% from Denmark and 1% each comes from Spain and the Netherlands. 1% is delievered by boat, 4% are delievered by freight train and 98% by lorry. The averag import distance is 696 km.
Location: &lt;null&gt;
Technology: undefined
Time period: undefined
Production volume: CH consumption of roof tiles and bricks: 842 kt
Sampling: statistical data 
Extrapolations: none
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9a24b457-efb1-3190-b9de-7b7d6b6f59f1.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
